+# Ledger
+
+### Root cause: implicit-assumption
+`Flask.run` assumed the first colon in `SERVER_NAME` separates a hostname from its port; bracketed IPv6 literals contain address colons before that delimiter.
+
+Fix: split bracketed values at `]:` after removing the opening bracket. Prevention: retain a regression test for `SERVER_NAME="[::1]:8080"`.
+
+### Verify: Bracketed IPv6 SERVER_NAME defaults to its unbracketed host and configured port; existing hostname and port-zero behavior remains covered.
+`pytest -q` exit 127 · tree 9e2ef42f8bc4fe6969770101b1ea0ef189ce6055
+
+### Verify: Bracketed IPv6 SERVER_NAME defaults to its unbracketed host and configured port; existing hostname and port-zero behavior remains covered.
